            <div style={{ fontSize:11, color:"#555", marginBottom:8 }}>
              {library.length} tracks · {library.filter(s=>s._exportify).length} <span style={{ color:"#f97316" }}>📊 Exportify</span> · {library.filter(s=>!s._exportify&&s.b>0).length} <span style={{ color:"#a78bfa" }}>🤖 Claude</span> · {library.filter(s=>!s.b||s.b===0).length} <span style={{ color:"#555" }}>⚪ No data</span>
